<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz 1996 trade deficit widens to $386.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz 1996 trade deficit widens to $386.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan posted a trade deficit of $386.5 million in 1996, up from a gap of $136.6 million in 1995, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>KYRGYZ MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Dec 96  Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> exports ($ mln)		 505.4	464.2	  408.0</p>
<p> imports			   891.9	796.8	  544.6</p>
<p> trade balance		  -386.5     -332.6	 -136.6</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
